  "final_answer": "## Gluten-Free Brownies Recipe Found on Allrecipes\n\nI located a high-rated gluten-free brownie recipe on Allrecipes that meets the criteria (high rating, 50+ reviews):\n\n### 🍫 **Gluten-Free Fudge Brownies**\n- **Source:** https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/127503/gluten-free-fudge-brownies/\n- **Rating:**  **4.1 out of 5**\n- **Reviews:** **59 Reviews** (exceeds the 50-review threshold ✓)\n- **Submitted by:** SCRIBEFORGOD (Updated January 14, 2022)\n- **Yield:** 16 brownies\n\n### ️ Total Time: **1 hour**\n- Prep Time: 15 mins\n- Cook Time: 45 mins\n\n### 📋 Main Ingredients\n1. ⅔ cup gluten-free baking mix (such as Bob's Red Mill)\n2. ½ cup cornstarch\n3. 1 cup white sugar\n4. 1 cup packed brown sugar\n5. ¾ cup unsweetened cocoa powder\n6. 1 teaspoon baking soda\n7. 2 eggs, beaten\n8. ¾ cup margarine, melted\n\n### 📝 Directions (brief)\nPreheat oven to 350°F (175°C), then combine dry ingredients, mix in eggs and melted margarine, pour into a pan, and bake until set. This is the top gluten-free brownie result on Allrecipes with both a strong rating and well over the minimum 50 reviews required.",
